    "resolvedAttempts": "Initial fixture used only g34_Discard, but native discard prompts use discard at n1 and discardSelect at n>=2. Corrected source selection to the intended exact Pokopy UID when two same-named hand copies exist. Shuffle verification now checks whether randomization occurred rather than assuming a fixed number of internal random calls for different remaining deck sizes. Original failure logs retained."
